<title>UK: Banque Paribas sets $1.0 bln 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Banque Paribas sets $1.0 bln 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Paribas Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE PARIBAS</p>
<p> AMT    $1.0 BLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/8 PCT   PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.848    FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    99.848</p>
